  "prefLabel": "Sphc 502.01 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sphc 502.01 Scope.\n\n(a) The ethical standards in Sphc 503 shall apply to speech-language pathologists, whether or not they hold a CCC, and individuals certified as speech-language assistants.\n\n(b) The ethical standards in Sphc 504 shall apply to audiologists and registered hearing aid dealers.\n\nSource. #14311, eff 7-10-25, EXPIRES: 7-10-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sphc500.html"
